{{bor+|ru|de|Absatz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|абза́ц}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-абзац.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|абза́ц|adj=абза́цный}}

# {{lb|ru|grammar}} [[paragraph]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[де́лать]] '''абза́ц'''|t=to make a paragraph}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[нача́ть]]/[[начина́ть]] [[с]] (но́вого) '''абза́ца'''|t=to begin a (new) line/paragraph; to indent a line}}
# {{lb|ru|informal}} an [[indentation]] at the start of a paragraph
#: {{syn|ru|о́тступ|[[абза́цный]] [[о́тступ]]|кра́сная строка́}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[де́лать]] '''абза́ц'''|t=to indent}}
# {{qualifier|euphemism}} for {{m|ru|пизде́ц}}
#: {{syn|ru|пипе́ц|писе́ц|капе́ц}}

====Usage notes====
'''Абзац''' translates as [[paragraph]] and is marked by an [[indentation]] and by the [[typographical]] [[character]] [[¶]]. Conversely, {{m|ru|пара́граф}} translates as [[section]], is demarked by a [[section break]], and by the symbol [[§]]. Compare also {{m|ru|разде́л}}.

